{"id":"vod_sn_37218","vodId":"37218","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"梦色糕点师第二季","name_cn":"梦色糕点师第二季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3f4be5f41d5d26ec2705cc5c91db8b32.jpg"},"summary":"十三岁的天野草莓（悠木碧 配音）是一个单纯善良活泼可爱的少女，草莓对于蛋糕有着无尽的喜爱，因为蛋糕是能够给他人带来幸福的美味。可是，草莓的心中甚至自己的笨拙与无能，因此，在追逐梦想的道路上，她显得如此怯懦。一次偶然中，草莓在蛋糕展览会上遇见了安立老师，老师发现了草莓在制作蛋糕方面所拥有的惊人天赋，鼓励草莓前往久负盛名的专业糕点学校“圣玛丽学园”深造。经过深思熟虑，草莓决定勇敢的接受老师的建议，就这样，她在职业蛋糕师的道路上迈出了第一步。在学校中，有着许许多多和草莓一样对蛋糕怀抱着巨大热情的孩子们，在这里，草莓能够战胜劲敌，脱颖而出吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Yr04YCvcE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/N5f4959PVd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GHAPixWshx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jpXzTnqTYz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wyiP3uCsH01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/V6zKaj3pM01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QHWXvf19G71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x7pn4bjinh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sprj8C8K1Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kcz7htY1aY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WFHEzuwLwf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aY41smptir1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.573Z"}